# Normalise line endings in the repository to LF, and check out LF on every platform.
#
# Without this, git's autocrlf rewrites files on checkout, so a file restored from a
# commit is byte-different from the same file before it was committed. That made a
# raw hash comparison during mutation testing report a mismatch on identical content.
# Hash checks should be unambiguous.
* text=auto eol=lf
